                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "You can get the best results from your medications by completing the items on this \u201cTo-Do List.\u201d",
                    "string_replacements": {
                        "default": {
                            "Chinese": "\u5b8c\u6210\u672c\u300c\u884c\u52d5\u6e05\u55ae\u300d\u4e0a\u6240\u5217\u7684\u5404\u7a2e\u4e8b\u9805\uff0c\u60a8\u5c07\u80fd\u900f\u904e\u60a8\u7684\u85e5\u7269\u5f97\u5230\u6700\u4f73\u6cbb\u7642\u6548\u679c\u3002",
                            "Spanish": "Usted podr\u00e1 obtener los mejores resultados de sus medicamentos completando todos los pasos en esta <b>\u201cLista de Cosas por Hacer.\u201d</b>",
                            "Vietnamese": "<font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>Qu\u00fd v\u1ecb c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t t\u1eeb thu\u1ed1c c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c trong</font> <font fontname='Arial-Bold'>\u201cDanh S\u00e1ch Vi\u1ec7c C\u1ea7n L\u00e0m\u201d</font> <font fontname='Arial-Unicode-normal'>n\u00e0y.</font>"
